			"notes": "Forge 1.20.1 backport of the latest Admin Logger 2.3.1 feature set.\n\nHighlights:\n- Adds block, container, item, gamemode, teleport, and dimension-change audit logging.\n- Adds player/world/command filters, JSONL logs, global index, alerts, Discord webhook support, and session stats.\n- Refactors the Forge 1.20.1 codebase into the same service/event architecture used by the newer releases.\n\nCompatibility:\n- Minecraft 1.20.1\n- Forge 47.4.20+\n- Java 17\n\nBuild verification:\n- `./gradlew.bat clean build`"
		},
