			"notes": "## Local do Log\n\n```\n/minecraftserver/logs/adminlogger/<player>/\n```\n\n## Formato do Log\n\n```\n[HH:mm:ss] NomeJogador - ação\n```\n\nExemplo:\n```\n[14:30:45] Steve - entrou no servidor\n[14:31:00] Steve - chat: Olá pessoal!\n[14:31:15] Steve - comando: /help\n[14:35:20] Steve - saiu do servidor\n```\n\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d8b01e3-430e-404d-9a56-2c3fec10fbc3)"
